# ReportKit Core — project identity

This repository (`Maijied/Reportkit-Core`) is a **completely new, standalone** open-source project. It is not a fork of Shohoz bus and must not be committed back into host app remotes unless the user explicitly asks.

## Author (always use)

- **Name:** Mohammad Maizied Hasan Majumder
- **Email:** mdshuvo40@gmail.com
- **Roles:** Founder & Principal Engineer at Lorapok Labs (lorapok.labs) · Senior Software Engineer @ Shohoz Ltd (shohoz.com)

Use this author for `composer.json`, LICENSE, README, AUTHORS.md, and git commits (`--author` / `-c user.name` / `-c user.email`). Do not use generic “ReportKit Contributors” or Cursor attribution trailers.

## Scope

- Package name: `reportkit/core`
- Framework-agnostic PHP **5.6 → current** (language level stays 5.6-compatible)
- Ecosystem goal: Laravel **4.1 → currently supported** (12.x / 13.x) via `laravel-legacy` + `laravel` adapters — see `docs/COMPATIBILITY.md`
- Domain SQL stays out of this package
- Git remotes / push targets: **only** `https://github.com/Maijied/Reportkit-Core.git` (or `git@github.com:Maijied/Reportkit-Core.git`) unless the user names another ReportKit repo
